4. Course material that is NOT here
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A vendored tree of third-party lecture transcripts and slide text
(`knowledge/quantum/quantathon/`) was removed on 2026-08-05: talks by named
speakers with no declared license cannot be redistributed, and attribution does
